WEBVTT

caption-01
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Fresh fruit waits on the kitchen counter.

caption-02
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.500
She rinses the berries and sets up the board.

caption-03
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.750
Strawberries, orange, and apple are sliced.

caption-04
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.000
Kiwi rounds and watermelon cubes join in.

caption-05
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.250
Grapes tumble into the big salad bowl.

caption-06
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.500
She stirs, tastes, and presents the fruit salad.
